 experience with \\\\*\\\\*economy or gambling bots\\\\*\\\\* (preferred) --- ## \\\\*\\\\*💰 Budget Range\\\\*\\\\* \\\\*\\\\*$20 – $50 total\\\\*\\\\* \\\\*(Negotiable based on experience & feature scope)\\\\* --- ## \\\\*\\\\*⏳ Timeline\\\\*\\\\* \\\\*\\\\*2–4 weeks\\\\*\\\\* (can be discussed) --- ## \\\\*\\\\*📩 Contact Method\\\\*\\\\* DM me on Discord with: - Portfolio or previous bots - Preferred language (\\\\*\\\\*JS or Python\\\\*\\\\*) - Estimated delivery time --- ## \\\\*\\\\*ℹ️ Additional Details\\\\*\\\\* - I must receive \\\\*\\\\*full source code\\\\*\\\\* - I will own the \\\\*\\\\*bot token & hosting\\\\*\\\\* - \\\\*\\\\*Milestone-based payment\\\\*\\\\* preferred - Long-term support/upgrades possible if work quality is good\\n\\nA\\n\\n! Aric\\n\\nCopy Paster!\\n\\n61 messages\\n\\n5 members\\n\\n14 hours ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/en/marketplace/1457717311200034879)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### WE ARE HIRING!\\n\\nJob\\n\\nBackend ⚙️Frontend 🌐AI/ML 🤖Full-Stack 🔄\\n\\n💻 Web Developer (Remote) — Kiggla 🚀 Kiggla (https://kiggla.com/), a fast-growing IT services startup, is hiring a Web Developer with strong client-facing communication skills 💬. 🛠️ Tech Stack: Frontend: React ⚛️ | Next.js | TypeScript Backend: Node.js | Python (other stacks welcome) ⭐ Bonus: AI knowledge 📌 Details: 🌍 Fully remote 💰 $1,500–$2,000/month 🔗 Active LinkedIn required 📩 Apply: 💬 Discord: @CandleR 📲 Telegram: golf\\\\_crazy15\\n\\nS\\n\\nCandleR\\n\\nCopy Paster!\\n\\n4 messages\\n\\n4 members\\n\\na day ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/en/marketplace/1457504135015563431)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Senior Software Engineer - Remote Part time Job\\n\\nJob\\n\\nAI/ML 🤖Full-Stack 🔄\\n\\nHappy New Year!!! Our development team is made up of highly experienced engineers with more than 10 years of experience. We are a next-generation Technology as a Service (TaaS) company capable of working with any programming language, framework, mobile platform, or web technology without limitations. As we move into t