s and view them as decompiled source, raw bytecode, SSA intermediate representation, or hex. Beyond just viewing, it includes analysis tools like call graphs, cross-references, dependency visualization, and data flow analysis. It also ships with a number of built in IR optimization passes available. There's also a built-in scripting engine for writing custom transforms against the AST or IR. Built on Swing with multiple theme options. For more detailed information please see the readme. Would love to hear any feedback, especially critiques or suggestions for improvement.\\n\\nT\\n\\nTonicBox\\n\\nSpielt Custom Status\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n0 Nachrichten\\n\\n1 Mitglieder\\n\\n20 days ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1450580443496710255)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Spotify song rating\\n\\njava\\n\\nS\\n\\nDroid\\n\\nSpielt Custom Status\\n\\nCopy Paster!\\n\\n1 Nachrichten\\n\\n0 Mitglieder\\n\\n21 days ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1450310261960347751)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Uncensored TikTok\\n\\nhtml & css\\n\\nhttps://brainrot.cam/ Feel free to leave your opinion\\n\\nS\\n\\nDeep State Jew Nr. 1\\n\\nCopy Paster!\\n\\n0 Nachrichten\\n\\n0 Mitglieder\\n\\n21 days ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1450260640307478719)\\n\\n[\\n\\n![Just some simple chess engine](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.discordapp.com%2Fattachments%2F1450105821139832953%2F1450105821433168067%2Fimage.png%3Fex%3D695dac09%26is%3D695c5a89%26hm%3D6ab5e0616353a246aa84b20c387e9837fc1f1cce19535b627dd7cf552021bde4%26&w=3840&q=75)\\n\\n### Just some simple chess engine\\n\\nHas: - Sound - Checkmate - Suggestions - Menus - Seamless rendering - Game Modes > Play vs computer > Play boths ides\\n\\nY\\n\\nYouDev\\n\\nHelper\\n\\n11 Nachrichten\\n\\n3 Mitglieder\\n\\n22 days ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1450105821139832953)\\n\\n[\\n\\n![🚀 HarisLab – Free Online Developer Tools, Productivity Suite & Browser Games (No Ads!)](/_next/image?url=htt