d with Cognitive, Affective, and Psychomotor taxonomies (learning objectives). It's designed to help you learn anything, step by step. Our model creates a Knowledge Graph of what you need to know and uses that as a curriculum to build your personalized learning path. Compas AGT learns from your learning patterns and psychometric data to deliver a uniquely personalized learning experience that adapts to you, not the other way around. This isn't just another chatbot. It's a fundamental shift in how we approach knowledge. This is Compas AGT, and it's here to help the next generation of the workforce upskill smarter. Compas AGT is currently in its Early Preview phase, available in select regions, with some areas potentially experiencing slower responses. As we continue refining and expanding its capabilities, you’ll notice the experience evolving rapidly with each new improvement and enhancement we roll out. Try agt.compasai.com right now!\\n\\nD\\n\\nd.bobola.ai\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n6 Nachrichten\\n\\n4 Mitglieder\\n\\n5 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1406381313514274917)\\n\\n[\\n\\n![Hey everyone!I built a Markdown note-taking app for students and creators 📚](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.discordapp.com%2Fattachments%2F1406346077136879627%2F1406346077971415181%2F0.png%3Fex%3D695d5659%26is%3D695c04d9%26hm%3D027ced318f84677f1c9c83a5f63bf7896bdb6e21be136f8349278b5ab6cdb4f3%26&w=3840&q=75)\\n\\n### Hey everyone!I built a Markdown note-taking app for students and creators 📚\\n\\nArchiviert 4 months ago\\n\\nhtml & css go\\n\\nHey everyone! It’s a web-based note-taking app designed primarily for students, but also great for developers, content creators, and anyone who writes a lot. The goal is to offer a beautiful, intuitive interface and produce clean, well-formatted documents—without the frustration of traditional tools like Word. You can easily manage hundreds of notes, organize them into folders, export them, and boost your productivity with custom snippets, markdown shortcuts, and more. ## 🛠 Tech stack: - Frontend: Vue.js + Nuxt - Backend: Go - Storage: MinIO + MySQL I’m currently the only developer working on it, but I’d love to have contributors! Whether you’re into coding, UI/UX, documentation, or just want to share feedback and suggestions, you're very welcome to join 🫶 👉 GitHub repo: https://github.com/Smaug6739/Alexandrie If you like the idea, a ⭐ on GitHub would mean a lot — and feel free to reach out if you want to get involved!\\n\\nS\\n\\nExpress.js\\n\\n0 Nachrichten\\n\\n0 Mitglieder\\n\\n5 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1406346077136879627)\\n\\n[\\n\\n![My first red team project. Have mercy](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.discordapp.com%2Fattachments%2F1406123852937039995%2F1406123853343621231%2FIMG_8059.png%3Fex%3D695d3023%26is%3D695bdea3%26hm%3D0a26a011216279ce003135375a1246c76997c84cbe446b237709ced562a9a614%26&w=3840&q=75)\\n\\n### My first red team project. Have mercy\\n\\nArchiviert 4 months ago\\n\\nI built a CRT-less manual map loader that’s only 4KB, handling relocations, imports, API hashing, syscall fallbacks, and stealth memory protections without relying on the C runtime. The loader carries an encrypted, embedded stage2 that’s 11KB and also CRT-less, it installs a root CA, sets the system proxy to an external server, and adds stealth layers like AMSI and ETW patching, NTDLL unhooking, and UAC elevation. Small footprint, no CRT overhead, fully obfuscated, and tuned for quiet execution. Each payload build is polymorphic due to encryption and section renaming.\\n\\nN\\n\\nVibe Coder!\\n\\n4 Nachrichten\\n\\n1 Mitglieder\\n\\n5 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1406123852937039995)\\n\\n[\\n\\n![🎨 SubSlay.app – Turn your text into color!](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.discordapp.com%2Fattachments%2F1405938354985373747%2F1405938355287359562%2Fi_love_tree.png%3Fex%3D695d2c20%26is%3D695bdaa0%26hm%3D2fdaa4d61999e2d1accb