ase DM me!\\n\\nE\\n\\nEric Jonasson\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n0 Nachrichten\\n\\n1 Mitglieder\\n\\n12 hours ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/marketplace/1457741385817002084)\\n\\n[\\n\\n![Custom DonutSMP Gambling Discord Bot (Discord.js / Python)](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.discordapp.com%2Fattachments%2F1457717311200034879%2F1457717311547904139%2FScreenshot_2026-01-05_174124.png%3Fex%3D695dad4a%26is%3D695c5bca%26hm%3D6f9f0834d0cb3385571939c355b28195acee06cbacad59298504393910ac2833%26&w=3840&q=75)\\n\\n### Custom DonutSMP Gambling Discord Bot (Discord.js / Python)\\n\\nJob\\n\\nBackend ⚙️Bot Dev 🤝\\n\\nI’m looking for an experienced \\\\*\\\\*Discord bot developer\\\\*\\\\* to build a \\\\*\\\\*custom gambling bot\\\\*\\\\* for a \\\\*\\\\*DonutSMP-based Discord server\\\\*\\\\*. The bot will allow users to gamble using their \\\\*\\\\*in-game DonutSMP cash\\\\*\\\\*, which is transferred between Minecraft and Discord via a designated in-game player account acting as the \\\\*\\\\*bank/bot\\\\*\\\\*. --- ## \\\\*\\\\*🧠 Core Concept\\\\*\\\\* - Users \\\\*\\\\*deposit DonutSMP cash\\\\*\\\\* by sending money in-game to a specific Minecraft account (bank/bot) - The Discord bot \\\\*\\\\*tracks deposits\\\\*\\\\*, maintains user balances, and enables gambling inside Discord - Users can \\\\*\\\\*withdraw winnings\\\\*\\\\*, triggering a payout from the bank account back to the player in-game --- ## \\\\*\\\\*🛠 Planned Features\\\\*\\\\* - Secure \\\\*\\\\*deposit & withdrawal system\\\\*\\\\* linked to in-game currency - User balance tracking & \\\\*\\\\*transaction logs\\\\*\\\\* - Gambling games (e.g. \\\\*\\\\*poker, mines, coinflip\\\\*\\\\*, etc.) - \\\\*\\\\*Slash commands\\\\*\\\\* - Admin controls & \\\\*\\\\*anti-abuse protections\\\\*\\\\* - Clean, \\\\*\\\\*scalable codebase\\\\*\\\\* with proper permissions I will provide \\\\*\\\\*full concept details and example images\\\\*\\\\* in DMs for better understanding. --- ## \\\\*\\\\*✅ Required Skills\\\\*\\\