he processing is done directly in your browser, which means your data is completely private and the process is very fast. \\\\* \\\\*\\\\*Radical Transparency:\\\\*\\\\* You can watch the AI \\\"struggle\\\" in a live log. It shows you every attempt, failure, and which strategy finally succeeded. I'd love to hear your thoughts and any feedback you might have. Let me know what you think\\n\\nA\\n\\nArdelyo\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n2 messages\\n\\n3 members\\n\\n5 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/en/community/showcase/1404787086552207452)\\n\\n[\\n\\n![QuickBrowse](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.discordapp.com%2Fattachments%2F1404775268358422600%2F1404775269851467847%2Fimage.png%3Fex%3D695d8e2b%26is%3D695c3cab%26hm%3D556ea01d5a74d053d1c047d719ad781eb3b3fa6ac4aaab4bd770ba313228b43d%26&w=3840&q=75)\\n\\n### QuickBrowse\\n\\nArchived 3 months ago\\n\\nQuickBrowse is a Browse especially designed for browsing together, with QuickBrowse you can create browsing sessions with friends, where you have a Chat for communicating, you can watch together Youtube videos with real time sync aswell as tab and url sync, you see where your friend is and you can even share your cursor to show him something.Another feature is SplitView you can view multiple Tabs at once to improve productivity. But its not fully done, im currently working on the UI and improving performance. For more information look on my Github or DM me github: https://github.com/KreakxX/QuickBrowse feel free to star my Repo 👍\\n\\nK\\n\\nKreakxX\\n\\nHelper\\n\\n46 messages\\n\\n5 members\\n\\n5 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/en/community/showcase/1404775268358422600)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### shadcn-cookies\\n\\nArchived 4 months ago\\n\\nhtml & css\\n\\nSleek and flexible cookie consent component, designed with shadcn/ui site: https://shadcn-cookies.vercel.app gh: https://github.com/kaizenics/shadcn-cookies\\n\\nN\\n\\nNiko\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n0 messages\\n\\n1 members\\n\\n5 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/en/commu